    {
      "text": "Figure 4, 'Continuity of Care scenario: Paper First use case (UC001)'. The Figure 3 workflow with one path highlighted: arrival (1), vaccination (2), recording on the paper certificate (3) which gives Point A, then no digital health solution at the care site, so data entry personnel record the data in a digital health solution (5), reaching Point B, the record available in digital form. Step 4 and the connectivity decision are greyed out.",
